(text "TS06-FASCIA  -  control panel and product face"
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 25.4 33.02 0)
(effects
(font
(size 2.54 2.54)
)
)
(uuid "b4d94dce-8c6e-4dc1-9a43-863fd0cefbe5")
)
(text "Five controls, six wires. The ladder is why."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 25.4 38.1 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
)
(uuid "293b7d91-b602-443b-a8da-ced6bca2d48a")
)
(text "A6: five 4.7k 1% across +5V/GND, wiper picks a node. 23.5k string, 213uA,\nworst source Z 5.64k (ADC wants <10k). Taps land on 0/1/2/3/4/5 V ->\nADC 0/205/409/614/818/1023, worst gap 204 codes."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 25.4 45.72 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
)
(uuid "ee8f33ea-b724-462a-9fd9-c4e4d0f05a58")
)
(text "A7: 10k pull-up, 20k and 10k to ground. Four states at ADC\n1023 / 682 / 512 / 409, worst gap 103 codes."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 25.4 58.42 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
)
(uuid "054062b1-61af-4563-9d0b-161163a165d0")
)
(text "NOT on this board: the two 100nF filter caps. They go at the MAIN BOARD end\nof the cable, where they hold the last value if a non-shorting wiper floats\nand filter what the cable picks up passing a converter switching 185V at 31kHz."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 152.4 45.72 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
)
(uuid "d66c0f97-e999-49eb-b373-e9ed15774361")
)
(text "Every switch is panel-mount with solder lugs sitting >=11.3mm BEHIND this\nboard, pointing away. Nothing here is board-mounted; all are hand-wired to\nlanding pads. Pole 2 of the rotary is spare and unwired."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 152.4 58.42 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
)
(uuid "c20a056c-da52-4d13-8b5c-1bee2129bd28")
)
